        "label":  "KV Host Link Typed Safe Read Write",
        "disabled":  false,
        "info":  "Typed scalar reads plus a manual random write/restore check for signed, dword, long, float, and bit-in-word access. The write path saves every original value before writing and restores the saved snapshot afterward. Use only controlled test addresses because restoration can be interrupted by a transport or PLC failure."
